        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal mb-4">Macular Pucker / Epiretinal Membrane</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-text" role="list">
            <li>Mitchell P, et al. <em>Ophthalmology</em> 1997;104(7):1033-1040. doi: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/s0161-6420(97)30190-0" target="_blank" rel="noopener">10.1016/s0161-6420(97)30190-0</a> (Blue Mountains Eye Study)</li>
            <li>Fung AT, Galvin J, Tran T. <em>Clin Exp Ophthalmol</em> 2021. doi: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1111/ceo.13914" target="_blank" rel="noopener">10.1111/ceo.13914</a> (ERM review)</li>
            <li><em>Diagnostics</em> 2025;15(20):2596. doi: <a href="https://doi.org/10.3390/diagnostics15202596" target="_blank" rel="noopener">10.3390/diagnostics15202596</a> (newer SR, OCTA biomarkers in idiopathic epiretinal membrane)</li>
            <li>Christodoulou E, et al. <em>Ther Adv Ophthalmol</em> 2020. doi: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1177/2515841420927133" target="_blank" rel="noopener">10.1177/2515841420927133</a> (ILM peel meta-analysis)</li>
