            <li><em>J Curr Ophthalmol</em> 2026. doi: <a href="https://doi.org/10.4103/joco.joco_43_26" target="_blank" rel="noopener">10.4103/joco.joco_43_26</a> (newer SR+MA, caffeine &amp; IOP in healthy &amp; glaucomatous populations)</li>
