            <li>Hui F, Tang J, Williams PA, et al. <em>Clin Exp Ophthalmol</em> 2020;48(7):903-914. doi: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1111/ceo.13818" target="_blank" rel="noopener">10.1111/ceo.13818</a> (nicotinamide crossover RCT)</li>
            <li>Steigerwalt RD Jr, Belcaro G, Morazzoni P, et al. <em>Clin Ophthalmol</em> 2010;4:471-476. doi: <a href="https://doi.org/10.2147/opth.s9899" target="_blank" rel="noopener">10.2147/opth.s9899</a> (Mirtogenol + latanoprost)</li>
            <li>Jabbarpoor Bonyadi MH, et al. <em>BMC Complement Altern Med</em> 2014;14:399. doi: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1186/1472-6882-14-399" target="_blank" rel="noopener">10.1186/1472-6882-14-399</a> (saffron &amp; IOP)</li>
            <li>Peritore G, et al. <em>PLoS One</em> 2023;18(10):e0291836. doi: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0291836" target="_blank" rel="noopener">10.1371/journal.pone.0291836</a> (citicoline systematic review)</li>
            <li>Icel E, Akmaz O. <em>Beyoglu Eye J</em> 2026;11(1):1-12. doi: <a href="https://doi.org/10.14744/bej.2026.93709" target="_blank" rel="noopener">10.14744/bej.2026.93709</a> (newer SR, citicoline in ophthalmology)</li>
          </ul>
