        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal mb-4">How We Monitor for Updates</h2>
          <p class="text-text leading-relaxed">
            We scan the internet and scientific journals every week for updates, corrections, and new research related to the studies we are following.
            If a link moves, a DOI is corrected, or a key paper is superseded, we update this page and note the change.
          </p>
